@bartplessers The behaviour for preview in Lovelace is the same for me.
But if I click it the stream opens up in a pop-up and works (maybe a few seconds delayed, but a stream nonetheless). But after a few minutes, it stops working. Then I have to go to the "Integrations" section in HASS and in the "Tuya" menu click "Reload" which then fixes the stream in pop-up for a few minutes.

Might be a difference in the device, I have "Smart Camera (eqmbj0sz0ed9fqdk) by Tuya" which is actually "Immax NEO LITE Smart security camera VALL-I"
